\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Main results. Mean SDR in dB, higher is better. ``Studio'' is the four-stem mean on held-out Sanidha Concert03; ``Live'' is the three-stem mean (vocal, violin, mridangam) over all 168 unseen Saraga live multitracks. HPSS cannot name instruments, so its columns are the melodic and percussive groupings of the same stems on the same tracks.}}{4}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
