\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Resynthesis on held-out Concert03, mean over the four stems, dB, higher is better. Magnitude SNR is phase-blind and is the fair column for the phase-reconstructing methods.}}{4}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
