\newlabel{tab:bleed}{{3}{5}{Bleed metric: balanced accuracy (\%) over 13 classes, higher is better, and bleed mass, lower is better. Studio columns are clean stem / separated / clean $+$ others at $-12$\,dB / mixture. Live columns are live close mic / separated / --- / sum of close mics. Chance is 7.7\,\%}{table.3}{}}
